    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a great start. i want to take it even further though. help me write a section that basically dismantles the idea that the peasants or the starving urban poor actually caused anything. make it sound like they were just a mindless crowd being steered by his intellect, and that without his specific leadership, the revolution would have just fizzled out or stayed a minor riot. how can i phrase that so it sounds historically inevitable that he was the one in control?",
